{"_v":1,"id":"back-to-the-future-west-end-2021","cat":"west-end","cs":73,"rc":18,"bd":{"positive":11,"mixed":6,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Dominic Cavendish","o":"The Telegraph","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.telegraph.co.uk/theatre/what-to-see/back-future-musical-review-cars-star-feelgood-triumph/","d":"2021-09-13","q":"I needn’t have worried a nano-second."},{"cn":"Nick Curtis","o":"Evening Standard","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/culture/theatre/back-to-the-future-the-musical-review-b954981.html","d":"2021-09-13","q":"Even without Bart, though, director John Rando, choreographer Chris Bailey and designer Tim Hatley have together crafted a near-seamless slice of escapist entertainment."},{"cn":"David Benedict","o":"Variety","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://variety.com/2021/legit/reviews/back-to-the-future-musical-review-west-end-1235063882/","d":"2021-09-14","q":"Is it a great musical? Absolutely not."},{"cn":"Arifa Akbar","o":"The Guardian","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2021/sep/13/back-to-the-future-the-musical-review-adelphi-theatre","d":"2021-09-13","q":"Despite its inventions and its abundant splashiness, it is an odd mishmash of originality and imitation, the DeLorean remaining its biggest star."},{"cn":"Adam Feldman","o":"Time Out London","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/theatre/back-to-the-future-the-musical-review","d":"2026-01-15","q":"It is extra as hell, every scene drenched in song, dance, wild fantasy asides, fourth-wall-breaking irony and other assorted shtick."},{"cn":"Clive Davis","o":"The Times (UK)","s":40,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.com/culture/theatre-dance/article/back-to-the-future-the-musical-review-classic-stalls-like-an-old-delorean-njg5tp88x?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqf-6wn6DKrFsTE7Z0HLjPVLGSt4d0rpN6dBf0Wmj6QESad0D_05YlQf&gaa_ts=699b8aa1&gaa_sig=RiG1Bk1yTdai4IcIB88Z7pUq3_2X3t1Elw8YXVEc4zNaTHezETr13lhTyYrfR21Pcb_xGz