back-future-musical-adelphi-theatre-review-spectacular-west-end-show-delight-fans-old-and-new","d":"2021-09-28","q":"Picking up a blockbuster movie and dropping it on to a stage is far trickier than it sounds."},{"cn":"Unknown","o":"The Upcoming","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":3},{"cn":"Unknown","o":"Theatre Weekly","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":3,"q":"It’s like being in a Hollywood movie"},{"cn":"Unknown","o":"West End Wilma","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":3,"q":"Must-see nostalgia trip for fans of the original film"},{"cn":"Miriam Gibson","o":"London Box Office","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":3,"u":"https://www.londonboxoffice.co.uk/news/post/review-back-to-the-future-musical","d":"2022-09-12","q":"There’s one jaw-dropping effect in The Future’s finale which has audiences marvelling, “How did they do that?!”"},{"cn":"Unknown","o":"Musical Theatre Review","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":3,"q":"For many fans of the movie, the show will provide all the familiar ingredients they hoped for"}],"au":{"score":92,"designation":"Loving","sources":{"ss":{"s":92,"c":3767},"mz":{"s":86,"c":6945,"sr":4.3},"rd":{"s":67,"c":245,"tp":95,"sent":{"enthusiastic":0.17,"positive":0.45,"mixed":0.09,"negative":0.16,"neutral":0.13}},"sp":{"s":95,"c":5901,"sr":4.74},"lb":{"s":96,"c":1630,"sr":4.8},"ltd":{"s":95,"c":5049,"sr":4.8}}},"hi":"/images/shows/back-to-the-future-west-end-2021/hero.webp"}